<title>USA: Western Star /Lockheed Martin in deal.</title>
<headline>Western Star /Lockheed Martin in deal.</headline>
<dateline>ORISKANY, New York 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Western Star Trucks Holdings Ltd said on Wednesday that its wholly owned Orion Bus Industries Inc unit agreed with Lockheed Martin Corp to develop and produce hybrid electric transit buses for major users such as New York.</p>
<p>Lockheed Martin will provide the drive systems to Orion for the low floor buses provided by Orion.</p>
<p>Western Star said a prototype bus would be completed in the second quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>No financial details were provided.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
